<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<sbml xmlns="http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4" level="2" version="4">
  <model id="p_dynamics" name="p_dynamics - Protein autoregulation, Michaelis-Menten (Sriram 2026, Example 2)">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Dimensionless protein autoregulation model (Michaelis-Menten positive
feedback), Example 2 of Sriram, &quot;Graphical Analysis of Ordinary Differential
Equations in Biochemical Kinetics&quot;.</p>
        <p>Dimensional scheme: R1: production, v_f = k1*P/(K+P) (autocatalytic
production); R2: P -&gt; degradation, v_r = k2*P (first-order loss).</p>
        <p>Nondimensionalised with p = P/P0, P0 = K, tau = t/t0, t0 = 1/k2,
alpha = k1/(k2*K):  dp/dtau = alpha*p/(1+p) - p.</p>
        <p>Encoded here as two explicit reactions (production, degradation) with
reaction-level kineticLaws, matching the reaction-based SBML convention used
in Garde2020.xml, so that reaction/stoichiometry-based SBML importers can
recover v1(p) = alpha*p/(1+p) and v2(p) = p for rate-balance plots
(V1, V2 vs p).</p>
      </body>
    </notes>
    <listOfCompartments>
      <compartment id="cell" name="cell" spatialDimensions="3" size="1" constant="true"/>
    </listOfCompartments>
    <listOfSpecies>
      <species id="p" name="Dimensionless protein concentration" compartment="cell" initialConcentration="0.1" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false"/>
    </listOfSpecies>
    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter id="alpha" name="Dimensionless feedback strength (k1/(k2*K))" value="1.5" constant="true"/>
      <parameter id="k2" name="Dimensionless degradation rate constant" value="1" constant="true"/>
    </listOfParameters>
    <listOfReactions>
      <reaction id="production" name="Autocatalytic Michaelis-Menten production of p" reversible="false" fast="false">
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference species="p" stoichiometry="1"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <listOfModifiers>
          <modifierSpeciesReference species="p"/>
        </listOfModifiers>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <divide/>
              <apply>
                <times/>
                <ci> cell </ci>
                <ci> alpha </ci>
                <ci> p </ci>
              </apply>
              <apply>
                <plus/>
                <cn type="integer"> 1 </cn>
                <ci> p </ci>
              </apply>
            </apply>
          </math>
        </kineticLaw>
      </reaction>
      <reaction id="degradation" name="First-order degradation of p" reversible="false" fast="false">
        <listOfReactants>
          <speciesReference species="p" stoichiometry="1"/>
        </listOfReactants>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <times/>
              <ci> cell </ci>
              <ci> k2 </ci>
              <ci> p </ci>
            </apply>
          </math>
        </kineticLaw>
      </reaction>
    </listOfReactions>
  </model>
</sbml>
